sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    actor PH as Programme Head
    participant W as Web App
    participant SD as StudentDataService
    participant I as IndicatorFlagService
    participant K as AttributeKeyService
    participant N as NotificationService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Import student data (WF5)
    W->>SD: POST /api/StudentData/import
    SD->>DB: INSERT STUDENTDATA rows (one save)
    SD->>I: CheckAsync(adminId)
    I->>DB: Active indicators, enrolled active students, their STUDENTDATA rows of the watched attributes
    I->>I: Latest value per student, attribute, term and subject
    I->>K: DecryptValuesAsync(those values)
    I->>I: Compare with each rule inside the server (no ACCESSLOGS row, no person reads the value)
    I->>DB: INSERT new open flags (not for a student, rule, term and subject already dismissed or case-opened), clear open flags no longer hit and cancel their pending take-on requests (one save)
    I->>N: NotifyAsync(every Programme Head) when flags were raised
    I-->>SD: raisedCount, clearedCount
    SD-->>W: Import result with raisedFlagCount and clearedFlagCount
    PH->>W: Open "Students in need"
    W->>I: GET /api/IndicatorFlags/search?status=open
    I-->>W: Flags by severity, priority, oldest (directory data and rule only, never the value), with pendingTakeOnRequestCount
    alt open a case
        PH->>W: Open a case for an advisor of the rule's support type
        W->>I: PUT /api/IndicatorFlags/{id}/open-case {advisorId, reason}
        I->>DB: INSERT CASES (openedBy = Programme Head, rule category, flag severity, priority and subject, stage assigned) and its CASESTAGEHISTORIES row, UPDATE INDICATORFLAGS (caseId, status = caseOpened, resolvedBy, resolvedAt), cancel pending take-on requests (one save)
        I->>N: Notify the student, the advisor and the advisors whose requests were cancelled
    else dismiss
        PH->>W: Dismiss with a reason
        W->>I: PUT /api/IndicatorFlags/{id}/dismiss {dismissReason}
        I->>DB: UPDATE INDICATORFLAGS (status = dismissed, resolvedBy, resolvedAt), cancel pending take-on requests (one save)
    end
